OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ALauryn Hill, Wyclef and Giggs among
OL,4,Asurprise guests at Jay-Z's long-awaited
OL,5,AUK show
OL,6,
OL,7,FJay-Z's first headline solo show in the
OL,8,FUK in more than a decade saw him
OL,9,Fcelebrate hip-hop culture alongside a
OL,10,Fhost of special guests, including
OL,11,FLauryn Hill, Wyclef Jean and Giggs.
OL,13,FThe US rap superstar rolled back the
OL,14,Fyears for more than two hours - playing
OL,15,Fhits like 99 Problems, Empire State of
OL,16,FMind and Dead Presidents - as he took
OL,17,Fto the stage at Tottenham Hotspur
OL,18,FStadium on Friday night for the first
OL,19,Fof two shows in London this weekend.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
